{"t":"UNP","made":"2026-11-20 01:31","name":"Union Pacific Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Railroads","employees":28658,"hq":"Omaha, NE, United States","website":"https://www.up.com","summary_en":"Union Pacific Corporation, through its subsidiary, Union Pacific Railroad Company, operates in the railroad business in the United States. It offers transportation services for grain and grain products, fertilizers, food and refrigerated products, and coal and renewables to grain processors, animal feeders, and ethanol and renewable biofuel producers; and construction products, industrial chemicals, plastics, forest products, specialized products, metals and ores, petroleum, liquid petroleum gases, soda ash, and sand, as well as finished automobiles, automotive parts, and merchandise in intermodal containers. The company was founded in 1862 and is headquartered in Omaha, Nebraska.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Union Pacific Corporation은 자회사인 Union Pacific Railroad Company를 통해 미국에서 철도 사업을 운영하고 있습니다. 곡물 가공업체, 동물 사료 공급업체, 에탄올 및 재생 가능한 바이오 연료 생산업체에 곡물 및 곡물 제품, 비료, 식품 및 냉장 제품, 석탄 및 재생 가능 에너지에 대한 운송 서비스를 제공합니다. 건설자재, 공업용 화학제품, 플라스틱, 임산물, 특수제품, 금속 및 광석, 석유, 액화석유가스, 소다회, 모래, 완성차, 자동차 부품, 복합컨테이너 상품 등을 포함합니다. 이 회사는 1862년에 설립되었으며 네브래스카주 오마하에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":291.72,"mcap":173354729472.0,"pe":22.755072,"fpe":20.266693,"peg":2.9072,"ps":6.5756826,"pb":7.8730464,"ev_ebitda":15.574,"div":1.89,"beta":0.845,"hi52":315.99,"lo52":219.98},"fin":{"rev":26363000832.0,"rev_g":0.153,"eps_g":0.159,"gross":0.55768,"op":0.4075,"net":0.28897,"roe":0.38747,"fcf":5069624832.0,"cash":3086000128.0,"debt":31111999488.0,"de":141.303,"eps":12.82,"feps":14.39406},"own":{"short":0.056999996,"inst":0.92254996,"insider":0.00155},"analyst":{"n":24,"mean":329.95834,"median":335.0,"high":375.0,"low":245.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.8,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":14,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":15,"